    "description": "URI不存在。可能原因: 1.入参uri路径不正确; 2.入参uri格式不正确。处理步骤: 咨询DataShare服务端提供者获取正确的uri路径"
  },
  {
    "code": "15700012",
    "message": "The data area does not exist.",
    "source_file": "docs/.../errorcode-datashare.md + frameworks/js/napi/common/include/datashare_error.h",
    "description": "数据区不存在。可能原因: 接口publish的入参bundleName不正确。处理步骤: 咨询DataShare服务端提供者获取正确的bundleName"
